'NativeCAM acceptance test
'Post: ShopBot OpenSBP - NativeCAM 0.1
'Created: 2027-01-15 08:00
'File 3 of 3: one file per tool
'Material: Scrap for testing X300.000 Y200.000 Z19.000 mm
'Z zero: Material top  XY zero: Lower left
'T1 1/4in Upcut End Mill
IF %(25)=0 THEN GOTO UNIT_ERROR
SA
JS,338.67,169.33
'Load T1 1/4in Upcut End Mill and zero Z before starting
TR,16000
C6
'Second change back to T1 with a long toolpath name to fill the comment to the line limit T1
JZ,10.000
J2,270.000,20.000
JZ,2.000
MS,5.00,5.00
MZ,-0.500
MS,16.67,5.00
M2,290.000,20.000
JZ,2.000
JZ,25.000
J2,0.000,0.000
C7
END

UNIT_ERROR:
'This file is in millimetres; set ShopBot to millimetres and run it again.
PAUSE
END
